title: "The Junzi Codex"
abstract: >-
  A conduct codex for autonomous AI coding agents, skinned as the Confucian
  way of the junzi — four disciplines drawn from the Five Constants (Li, Zhi,
  Xin, Yi), each rule carrying an observable falsifier. Part of a small family
  of conduct harnesses.
